    "summary": "For a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE** model. In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase):\n\n1. Pick one enemy unit no more than 6″ from the bearer; it has to take a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).\n2. Roll one D6, whatever the test result; on a 3+, that unit takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.\n\nWhenever this Enhancement is used, the [Daemonic Terror](vsdata:ability/chaos-daemons.the-shadow-of-chaos) rule of your army inflicts no mortal wounds.",
